# Pharoam brand assets

Copyright © 2026 The Pharoam authors (the owner of the GitHub account that publishes this repository). All rights reserved.

"Pharoam", the Pharoam seal, the line P mark, the Pharoam wordmark, and the other files in this folder are the brand assets of the Pharoam authors. That includes the favicons, the app icon and the brand board.

## You may not, without our written permission

- **Any use:** use the brand assets or the name in or for any product, service, app, website, course, event or organisation, whether commercial or not.
- **Endorsement:** use them in a way that suggests Pharoam or its authors endorse, sponsor or are connected with you or your work.
- **Changes and look-alikes:** modify them, or make marks, logos, names or domain names that are confusingly similar, including other lighthouse "P" marks.
- **Forks:** use them in anything built from a fork of this repository.
- **Merchandise:** use them on merchandise, or in advertising, sponsorship or fundraising.
- **Registration:** register them, or anything similar, as a trademark, company name or domain name.

## You may

- Refer to Pharoam by name, accurately, and link to it.
- View and fork this repository on GitHub, as described in the repository `LICENSE`.

## Asking for permission

Ask in this repository's GitHub Discussions. If we give permission, it will be in writing, on terms we set at the time.

The wordmark is artwork made from the outlines of the Figtree typeface. Figtree itself stays under its own licence (see `THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md`); the wordmark is ours.
